Silero VAD weights
==================

File: silero_vad_16k.safetensors

Source:  https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
License: MIT License (https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad/blob/master/LICENSE)

The weights in this file were extracted from silero_vad.onnx (the 16kHz
inference branch) using scripts/convert_silero_vad.py and stored in the
safetensors format for use by the rmlx-audio VAD engine.

Original copyright holders: snakers4 and Silero Team contributors.

No modification was made to the numerical values — only the container
format was changed (ONNX → safetensors). The file is embedded into the rMLX
binary at build time (`include_bytes!`) and redistributed under the MIT terms
below (notice retained as required).

