Mel filterbanks
===============

Files: src/mel_filters_80.bin, src/mel_filters_128.bin

Source:  OpenAI Whisper / mlx_whisper (mel_filters.npz)
         https://github.com/openai/whisper (MIT License)

Standard log-mel filterbank matrices (80- and 128-band), as used by Whisper's
audio front-end and originally computed with librosa's mel-filter routine.
The values are deterministic filterbank constants (no learned weights). Stored
as flat little-endian f32 and embedded into the rMLX binary at build time
(`include_bytes!`); the build's mel output is verified bit-for-bit against the
librosa/Whisper reference in src/mel_tests.rs.
